{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 Clicker Heroes meets Vampire Survivors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iconic is a frantic, lane-based survival roguelite that fuses tight mechanics with relentless pressure. Fast clicks. Sharp reflexes. Tactical thinking. It\u2019s a rush of decisions and destruction where every move matters, and hesitation is fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021290/extras/e259cdfa5bb44abeace638d877ddb160.poster.avif?t=1757144704\" width=640 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021290/extras/e259cdfa5bb44abeace638d877ddb160.webm?t=1757144704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd27 Tactical, Skill-Based Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Iconic</i>, every second counts. This isn\u2019t a game you coast through\u2014it\u2019s a gauntlet built for focus, not filler. While other survival roguelites drag you through 30-minute marathons, <i>Iconic</i> delivers a few minutes of pure intensity. You don\u2019t invest time\u2014you invest attention. Blink, and you\u2019re dead. Think fast, act faster, and make every move count.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 Evolving Meta. Real Progression,</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the chaos lies depth. Unlock a rich meta-progression system, stacked with upgrades, different game modes, and strategic choices that reward smart play. No grinding. No fluff. Just steady evolution\u2014your way, your pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021290/extras/f9747ab3a0d82e5fd0462ca900f35ee7.poster.avif?t=1757144704\" width=640 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021290/extras/f9747ab3a0d82e5fd0462ca900f35ee7.webm?t=1757144704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Smash. Slam. Repeat.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click hard, click fast. Wipe out waves of enemies, juggle lanes, and keep the chaos under control. It\u2019s all about quick moves and well timed hits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle an army of merciless monster icons in this lane-based horde survival roguelite frenzy and put an end to their evil endeavors. By clicking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a0\ufe0f Please note that this game is still in active development.<br>Visuals, features, and gameplay are all evolving\u2014what you see now may improve, change, or be replaced entirely. If something feels missing or rough, it\u2019s probably on our list!</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3021290?t=1757144704","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3021290?t=1757144704","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021290/a4de5345905504256805238dcddea0eccb8b861a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757144704","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3021290/a4de5345905504256805238dcddea0eccb8b861a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757144704","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3895590,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 Clicker Heroe